294
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,120
¡Esquívalo, Pikachu!

295
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,300
¡Pikachu!

296
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,500
¡Pikachu, estás bien, amigo!

297
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:16,840
