488
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:17,599
¡Te salvaré, Torchic!

489
00:17:19,700 --> 00:17:20,980
¡Ay, Torchic!

490
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:21,960
¡Aquí vienes!

491
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:23,500
¡Ve nada, hermana!

492
00:17:23,599 --> 00:17:24,260
