506
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,960
¡Torchic, ve!

507
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:54,000
¡Torchic!

508
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:55,340
¡Sorpresa!

509
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,240
